@Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5231

### Health check
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### List tickets for a user (seeded: alice has ticket 123)
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?userId=alice
Accept: application/json

### List tickets for a user with no tickets
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?userId=bob
Accept: application/json

### Get status of the seeded ticket
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/123
Accept: application/json

### Get status of a ticket that doesn't exist -> 404
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/999
Accept: application/json

### Create a new IT ticket
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "alice",
  "category": "IT",
  "subject": "Reset laptop password",
  "description": "Locked out after too many failed attempts, need a password reset."
}

### Create a new HR ticket
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "bob",
  "category": "HR",
  "subject": "Expense reimbursement question",
  "description": "Need help submitting a reimbursement for a client dinner."
}

### Create ticket with invalid payload -> 400 with validation errors
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "",
  "category": "Finance",
  "subject": "",
  "description": ""
}

### Get leave balance for alice
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/leave-balance/alice
Accept: application/json

### Get leave balance for bob
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/leave-balance/bob
Accept: application/json

### Get leave balance for a user that doesn't exist -> 404
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/leave-balance/carol
Accept: application/json

###
